  m_Name: 02_UpperArchive
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TheLightenRoad.Codex::TheLightenRoad.Codex.ArchiveLog
  Id: upper-archive
  Title: A Margin in the Dark
  Text: 'They called the light an endless gift. We counted every ember.


    Behind
    the upper shelves I kept a record of the flooded rooms. A circuit that opens
    a passage can wake the current beneath your feet. Watch both consequences before
    committing your light.'
  RoomClue: Powered water is dangerous; drained water is safe. One circuit may control
    more than one mechanism.
  Audio: {fileID: 0}
